{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"code","value":"const skipToken: typeof skipToken;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/query/blob/main/packages/query-core/src/utils.ts#L628","children":[{"type":"text","value":"packages/query-core/src/utils.ts:628"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Sentinel value that can be passed as a query's "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"queryFn"},{"type":"text","value":" to conditionally disable the query (equivalent\nto "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"enabled: false"},{"type":"text","value":") while preserving full type inference for the query's data. Unlike "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"enabled: false"},{"type":"text","value":",\na query disabled via "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"skipToken"},{"type":"text","value":" cannot be triggered with "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"refetch"},{"type":"text","value":"."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"example","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Example"}]},{"type":"code","value":"new QueryObserver(queryClient, {\n  queryKey: ['post', postId],\n  queryFn: postId != null ? () => fetchPost(postId) : skipToken,\n})","lang":"ts"}],"headings":[{"id":"example","text":"Example","level":2}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\n```ts\nconst skipToken: typeof skipToken;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/query-core/src/utils.ts:628](https://github.com/TanStack/query/blob/main/packages/query-core/src/utils.ts#L628)\n\nSentinel value that can be passed as a query's `queryFn` to conditionally disable the query (equivalent\nto `enabled: false`) while preserving full type inference for the query's data. Unlike `enabled: false`,\na query disabled via `skipToken` cannot be triggered with `refetch`.\n\n## Example\n\n```ts\nnew QueryObserver(queryClient, {\n  queryKey: ['post', postId],\n  queryFn: postId != null ? () => fetchPost(postId) : skipToken,\n})\n```\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: skipToken\ntitle: skipToken\n---\n\n```ts\nconst skipToken: typeof skipToken;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/query-core/src/utils.ts:628](https://github.com/TanStack/query/blob/main/packages/query-core/src/utils.ts#L628)\n\nSentinel value that can be passed as a query's `queryFn` to conditionally disable the query (equivalent\nto `enabled: false`) while preserving full type inference for the query's data. Unlike `enabled: false`,\na query disabled via `skipToken` cannot be triggered with `refetch`.\n\n## Example\n\n```ts\nnew QueryObserver(queryClient, {\n  queryKey: ['post', postId],\n  queryFn: postId != null ? () => fetchPost(postId) : skipToken,\n})\n```\n"}
